      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me out i'm a middle school teacher and im trying to put together a social studies lesson plan about social equity. i want it to be really engaging for my 12 year olds. basically i want to design a lesson that helps them understand why certain viewpoints on equity are seen as progressive and revolutionary, while others are seen as regressive or just stubborn. can u draft a rough outline for me?",
