      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the outline. i think the debate part is the most important. can you actually write out some specific talking points or \"perspectives\" for the students to use? i want to make sure the students can clearly distinguish between the progressive/revolutionary ideas and the regressive/stubborn ones so they don't get confused.",
