      "role": "user",
      "content": "that helps a lot. can u expand a bit more on the regressive/stubborn points though? i want to make sure i frame them in a way that shows why they're viewed that way—like, how their arguments often fall short or seem resistant to actual progress? i want the kids to see the contrast between the forward-thinking ideas and the more stuck ones.",
